1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:03,110
(Sheldon:)that ferments fruit
in order to become intoxicated.

2
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:04,780
(Sheldon:)Can you guess what the other is?

3
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:07,720
Hint: sometimes they pack
the alcohol

4
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:09,850
(Sheldon:)in their trunks.

5
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:11,960
(Penny:)Monkeys.

6
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:18,260
(Sheldon:)When does a monkey
have a trunk?

7
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:21,500
(Penny:)When a suitcase just won't do.

8
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:26,370
(Sheldon:)Mmm, all right.

9
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:28,440
(Sheldon:)It would appear as if alcohol

10
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:30,470
(Sheldon:)is playing keep-away
with your intelligence.

11
00:00:30,470 --> 00:00:32,370
(Raj:)Good night.

12
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,640
(Sheldon:)Please note,
it is now past 10:00 p.m.

13
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:37,280
(Sheldon:)Per our roommate agreement,
kindly refrain

14
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,680
(Sheldon:)from raucous laughter,

15
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:41,350
(Sheldon:)clinking of glasses,
and celebratory gunfire.

16
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:45,420
(Penny:)Okay...

17
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,320
(Penny:)explain something to me.

18
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:50,790
(Penny:)You watch Leonard put up with
that guy for years and years.

19
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:53,860
(Penny:)What has to break inside
your brain for you to think,

20
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:58,020
"Oh, Krishna, I've got to
get me some of that"?

